      "message": "I don\u0027t have a particular issue with adding a context here. However, I think it would be better to have a ValueMatcherContext interface that only provides the methods needed for the ValueMatcher implementations. That makes it easier to extend and test.\n\nI think at the moment it would only need to have a Config() method. You should not need an implementation of this interface, just pass the BottomUpMutatorContext.",
