      "writtenOn": "2021-12-08T10:30:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The name of the type makes it seem as though this is a general matcher for sdk_version but its implementation only supports one specific way of matching against the sdk_version.\n\nI think it would be better to abstract the matching behavior into a func that is passed in, along with a description of the matcher (for use by String()).\n\ne.g. something like:\n  type sdkVersionMatcher struct {\n    condition func(ctx ValueMatcherContext, spec SdkSpec) bool\n    description string\n  }\n  \nThen AtMostSdkVersion() can pass in a func that uses ApiLevel.LessThan(...) along with a string description.",
      "revId": "8bdfa51db860624f58f116ee4031f50d06ca06fe",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
